{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-25","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2011,"subject":"chemistry","number":25,"points":2,"unitId":"organic_rxn","unitLabel":"유기 반응","topic":"주생성물·생성물·합성","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["organic_rxn","stereo"],"stem":"다음은 출발 물질 A로부터 B를 거쳐 주생성물 D를 합성하는 \n과정이다. (단, 각 단계에서는 적절한 분리․정제 과정을 수행하였다.)\nH\nN\nO\n, H+\nN\nN\nH3C\n+\nH3C\nH3C\n단계  1\nA\nB\nC\n(B : C = 9 : 1)\nCN\n1) \n단계  2\n+\n2)  H3O\nO\nH3C\nCN\nD\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 단계 1은 축합(condensation) 반응이다.\nㄴ. 단계1에서 B가 C보다 많이 형성되는 것은 입체 효과\n(steric effect) 때문이다.\nㄷ. 단계2에서 B와 CH2＝CHCN의 반응은 1,2 󰠏첨가 반응이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t035"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t037"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":649,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,46.103,310.4,259.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-25/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":240,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,346.903,310.4,96.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t028","t029","t030","t031","t032"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-25/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":11,"sourceRect":[430.12,153.497,759.1,645.442],"w